# ── Code Graph (generated runtime, per-project) ─────────
# The large generated graph is rebuilt by /arib-graph build; not committed.
# The seed GRAPH_REPORT.md + graph-manifest.json ARE committed (honest "not built").
memory/code-graph/graph.json

# ── CCM Hook Artifacts ──────────────────────────────────
# High-volume hook logs — not committed.
io/hook-logs/
# Per-session marker file used by stop.sh to compute accurate diffs.
io/.session-start-sha
# io/ledger/ IS the audit trail and stays tracked — but only its durable
# parts. Per-session stubs are transient local runtime state: stop.sh
# writes one every session, so tracking them churns the repo and breaks
# the file-count guard (validate-coherence.sh §9) on every commit.
# Rotation (ADR-040) folds them into io/ledger/ARCHIVE-<YYYY>.md, which
# IS committed and holds one row per session — that is the trail.
io/ledger/session-*.md

# Autonomy mode runtime state (Item #10) — ephemeral per-session counters.
io/.autonomy/

# Invocation telemetry + notification trace (high-volume, per-project runtime)
io/ledger/invocations.jsonl
io/ledger/.notifications.jsonl

# Claude Code worktrees (transient, never committed)
.claude/worktrees/
